            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Writing a book can seem like a daunting prospect. However, with the right idea, motivation, and effort, it is entirely possible. In this &quot;How to&quot; article we demonstrate and explain how one can take their book idea and successfully deliver it to publication.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
